From 7a9b6f53b35e89219780e6a7530418037acbed3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Markus Hogsved <markus.hogsved@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:52:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(battery): additional_batteries - SOC chips and hover
 tooltip

Optional `entities.battery.additional_batteries` list. Each entry shows a
compact chip (icon + SOC) under the battery label, coloured as charging
or discharging when a power entity is given, and the battery circle gets
a native hover tooltip listing every battery's SOC and power. Clicking a
chip follows the card's normal tap/hold/double-tap handling for that
entry's state_of_charge entity. Without the option nothing changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
